			"Message": "feat(Common): Add ExtensionsActivate IPC channel definition\n\nIntroduce the `ExtensionsActivate` channel mapping to `\"extensions:activate\"` in the `DefineChannels!` macro within the IPC Channel.rs module. This provides a new strongly-typed IPC route for triggering extension activation across the gRPC boundary.\n\nThe channel sits between the existing extension host debug service channels and the previously defined `ExtensionsGet`/`ExtensionsGetAll` channels, completing the Extensions channel group with an activation signal. Consumers in Cocoon or Wind can now dispatch extension activation requests through the Common trait system rather than relying on ad-hoc command paths.",
			"SHA": "47d01e11da0da1b2e541f1620a6aeada116ac044"
		},
